{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578060/extras/54f87dc6210a25f9c6a91ed7bb534c25.avif?t=1767071295\" width=780 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield your weapons and your will to eradicate the dark magic that keeps you trapped in a world you abandoned long ago.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the arcane chains that once imprisoned the Lich were shattered, the world fell into darkness, bringing to life creatures that should not exist, ancient monsters and spirits whose intentions remain unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet the Lich\u2019s arrogance also awakened the ancient Souls of War, entities with their will intact, bound to a single purpose. Some seek peace; others, power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578060/extras/8a4206bc3069a6edf467a1be0ff543c1.avif?t=1767071295\" width=720 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into procedurally generated rooms every time you begin a new run, making each adventure feel entirely different from the last, alongside:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 distinct Soul classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32 unique weapons, each with its own specialty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 unique items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 zones to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578060/extras/787903c0898d11475e95c9613ab78d09.avif?t=1767071295\" width=720 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat aberrations in intense battles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Rogue Souls</strong>, not all encounters will be against random enemies. At the end of each zone, you will face a battle against one of its bosses. These fights will require a deeper understanding of the boss\u2019s abilities and the Soul you use to fight.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2578060?t=1767071295","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578060/e79bb622beccfcd098f703e083cc8acf7c740a51/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767071295","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578060/9c4ba091c89ce4d99c075b32275d7c4a5fed7b42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767071295","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578060/9c4ba091c89ce4d99c075b32275d7c4a5fed7b42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767071295","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2584410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578060/extras/54f87dc6210a25f9c6a91ed7bb534c25.avif?t=1767071295\" width=780 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield your weapons and your will to eradicate the dark magic that keeps you trapped in a world you abandoned long ago.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the arcane chains that once imprisoned the Lich were shattered, the world fell into darkness, bringing to life creatures that should not exist, ancient monsters and spirits whose intentions remain unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet the Lich\u2019s arrogance also awakened the ancient Souls of War, entities with their will intact, bound to a single purpose. Some seek peace; others, power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578060/extras/8a4206bc3069a6edf467a1be0ff543c1.avif?t=1767071295\" width=720 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into procedurally generated rooms every time you begin a new run, making each adventure feel entirely different from the last, alongside:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 distinct Soul classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32 unique weapons, each with its own specialty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 unique items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 zones to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578060/extras/787903c0898d11475e95c9613ab78d09.avif?t=1767071295\" width=720 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat aberrations in intense battles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Rogue Souls</strong>, not all encounters will be against random enemies. At the end of each zone, you will face a battle against one of its bosses. These fights will require a deeper understanding of the boss\u2019s abilities and the Soul you use to fight.</p>","developers":["TeJonGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578060/321d4acd7f834ea3d8241242adf846ac8c9ec656/header.jpg?t=1767071295","is_fre